\par\par \b \uc2 CIC Executive: See No Need To Set Up New  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 -Reserve Investment Funds - Report\b0\par\par\uc2 195 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Mai 2011\par 06:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BEIJING (Dow Jones)--An executive with \uc2 China Investment Corp\uc2 ., the country's sovereign wealth fund, said that he doesn't see a need for the country to set up any new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 -reserve investment funds, Caixin Media reported Friday on its website.\par \par \uc2 Jin Liqun, chairman of CIC's board of supervisors, said in a speech in Washington D.C that CIC has been covering most investment sectors and has done a good job with its investments, Caixin reported.\par \par \uc2 Chinese media reported last month that China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is planning to set up a variety of new funds that will make use of the country's massive \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, including special-purpose investment funds and a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  stabilization fund dedicated to \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which are the largest in the world, totaled $3.0447 trillion at the end of March, up $197.4 billion from the end of last year.\par \par \uc2 Newspaper website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.caing.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.caing.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 -By China Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; (8610) 8400-7799; djnews.beijing@dowjones.com [ 20-05-11 0418GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110520e75k0007e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
