75,000 and \uc2 LG Electronics\uc2  (066570.SE) slipped 0.5% to KRW101,500. (min-jeong.lee@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0738 GMT [Dow Jones] China government bonds end up amid increasing expectations that the PBOC has no plans to raise interest rates immediately, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  leaves the yield on the one-year bills sold in its regular open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  unchanged from the week before, says a Beijing-based trader with a local insurer. "It seems the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prefers quantitative measures, such as selling bills in open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  and raising reserve requirement ratios, rather than interest rate hikes in containing inflation at the current stage," he says. The Shanghai exchange government bond index ends at 127.54 compared with Monday's close at 127.53, and is likely to extend gains near-term as liquidity in the money market remains in excess despite the latest RRR hike. (ming.wang@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0737 GMT [Dow Jones] China is likely to reduce its daily crude runs substantially in March from record levels last month due to maintenance and relatively high domestic fuel stocks. Refineries are also operating on thin margins, as the government waits to raise prices at the pump despite crude oil prices rallying more than 10% on military \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Libya and unrest in Yemen and Bahrain. \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  Petroleum & Chemical Corp\uc2 . (SNP), China's top refiner by capacity, plans to process 17.7 million-17.8 million metric tons of crude oil in March, equivalent to an average of 4.19 million-4.2 million barrels/day. That represents a 3% drop from February and is the lowest level so far this year, according to energy portal Jcache. \uc2 PetroChina\uc2  (PTR), the nation's second-largest refiner, plans to cut daily crude 